erAria:`Filter knowledge packs`,libraryEmptyTitle:`No packs downloaded yet`,libraryEmptyDesc:`Your offline library is empty. When packs are available online, download them here for field use.`,libraryUnavailableTitle:`Library catalog unavailable`,libraryUnavailableDesc:`Unable to reach the knowledge pack catalog. Reconnect to inspect and download new packs.`,libraryPreviewPacksBtn:`Preview illustrative packs`,libraryOfflineCatalogTitle:`Knowledge pack catalog unavailable offline`,libraryOfflineCatalogDesc:`Discovering new knowledge packs requires internet. Installed packs remain searchable locally.`,noPacksMatching:`No knowledge packs match your filter.`,packDownloadBtn:`Download for Offline Use`,packDownloading:`Downloading & Verifying…`,packInstalled:`Installed on Device`,packRemoveBtn:`Remove from Device`,packRemoving:`Removing…`,packSourcesCount:`Sources`,packSize:`Storage Size`,packLastUpdated:`Last Updated`,packLastVerified:`Last Verified`,packChecksum:`SHA-256 Checksum`,packVersion:`Version`,packNotFoundTitle:`Knowledge pack not found`,packNotFoundDesc:`The requested knowledge pack does not exist or has been removed.`,illustrativePackWarning:`Illustrative preview — these packs are demonstration placeholders and cannot be downloaded.`,evidenceDetailsTitle:`Evidence Details`,overallAssessment:`Overall Evidence Assessment`,importantCaveats:`Important Caveats & Limits`,understandingStatuses:`Understanding Evidence Statuses`,understandingStatusesDesc:`How Plant Doctor evaluates agricultural evidence to protect crops from ungrounded advice.`,evidenceNotFoundTitle:`Evidence not found`,evidenceNotFoundDesc:`This evidence record does not exist or has expired.`,generatedAtLabel:`Generated at`,aboutTitle:`About Plant Doctor`,aboutSubtitle:`An offline-first, evidence-grounded agricultural assistant providing trustworthy crop health guidance to Indian farmers.`,aboutMissionTitle:`Mission & Principles`,aboutMissionDesc:`Plant Doctor equips smallholder farmers and extension workers with verified, source-traceable crop advice. Every recommendation is grounded in identifiable scientific literature, and every uncertainty is made explicit.`,aboutGateTitle:`Evidence Status Gate`,aboutGateDesc:`Our deterministic safety gate evaluates retrieved evidence before generating advice. It rejects cross-crop mismatches, flags outdated bulletins, highlights conflicting directives, and abstains when evidence is inadequate.`,aboutTrustTitle:`Source Trust & Provenance`,aboutTrustDesc:`Every piece of guidance is accompanied by transparent provenance credentials:`,aboutTrustItem1:`Original publishing university or agricultural research institute.`,aboutTrustItem2:`Official bulletin title, authors, and catalog identifiers.`,aboutTrustItem3:`Specific chapter, section, or page number of the source.`,aboutTrustItem4:`Direct citation to un-manipulated scientific text.`,aboutTrustItem5:`Date of publication and recent verification status.`,aboutArchTitle:`System Architecture`,aboutArchDesc:`Plant Doctor is built using open, accessible, and resilient technologies:`,aboutArchItem1:`FastAPI REST backend with PyMongo.`,aboutArchItem2:`MongoDB Atlas Vector Search ($vectorSearch) with FastEmbed dense semantic embeddings.`,aboutArchItem3:`Hybrid Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF) combining vector and lexical keyword search.`,aboutArchItem4:`Progressive Web App (PWA) with Workbox service worker caching for field reliability.`,aboutArchItem5:`Client-side IndexedDB with SHA-256 integrity checksums for offline knowledge packs.`,aboutLimitsTitle:`Current Operational Boundaries`,aboutLimitsItem1:`Field diagnoses from photographs are indicative; severe outbreaks require local KVK laboratory confirmation.`,aboutLimitsItem2:`Live vector search and vision analysis require internet; offline mode queries downloaded local packs.`,aboutLimitsItem3:`Speech recognition requires device microphone permissions and active browser engine support.`,aboutLimitsItem4:`Chemical recommendations are restricted to verified agronomic research; always observe pre-harvest intervals.`,aboutLimitsItem5:`Plant Doctor abstains rather than inventing speculative guidance when evidence is missing.`,aboutEthicsTitle:`Ethical Commitments`,aboutEthicsItem1:`Never fabricate agricultural guidance or hallucinate citations.`,aboutEthicsItem2:`Never sell farmer photos or store unconsented voice recordings.`,aboutEthicsItem3:`Never present machine guesses as certified veterinary or agronomic diagnoses.`,aboutEthicsItem4:`Always highlight safety precautions, protective equipment, and environmental cautions.`,aboutEthicsItem5:`Keep core farmer assistance accessible and free.`,aboutPwaTitle:`Install as Standalone App (PWA)`,aboutPwaDesc:`Plant Doctor can be installed directly onto your phone without an app store account:`,aboutPwaAndroidTitle:`Android (Google Chrome / Edge / Brave)`,aboutPwaAndroidStep1:`Open Plant Doctor in your mobile browser.`,aboutPwaAndroidStep2:`Tap the three-dot menu (⋮) in the top right.`,aboutPwaAndroidStep3:`Select "Install app" or "Add to Home screen".`,aboutPwaAndroidStep4:`Tap Install. The icon will appear alongside your regular apps.`,aboutPwaIosTitle:`iPhone / iPad (Apple Safari)`,aboutPwaIosStep1:`Open Plant Doctor in Safari on your iPhone.`,aboutPwaIosStep2:`Tap the Share icon (box with upward arrow) at the bottom.`,aboutPwaIosStep3:`Scroll down and tap "Add to Home Screen" (➕).`,aboutPwaIosStep4:`Tap Add. Plant Doctor will launch in full-screen standalone mode.`,aboutPwaNote:`Installing as a PWA caches the entire application shell, ensuring instant opening even in fields with zero mobile network coverage.`,aboutVersionBadge:`Plant Doctor V2.0 — Production Ready`,errorEmptyQuestion:`Please speak or enter a question before submitting`,errorShortQuestion:`Please add a few more details about your plant symptoms (at least 5 characters).`,errorImageTooLarge:`The selected photograph is too large (maximum 10MB). Please choose a smaller image.`,errorInvalidIm